From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: irisrun <irisrun@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:28:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/37] Draw paths, strokes, path clips and styled text with
 the render core

The layer renderer draws shapes other than rectangles, rounded rectangles and
circles as render core shape layers: filled with the fill rule, or for a
stroked path, stroked with its width, caps, joins, miter limit and dashes.
Clips to other paths become layer masks.

Text is drawn and measured in runs: font size, weight and slant, color,
underline, strikethrough, kerning, tracking and baseline offset per run, and
line spacing for the paragraph. Fonts resolved without CoreText now carry
italic.
